<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0F172A" />
  <title>ANONDO — Koushik's Daily Clarity, Active Listening & Zorba Companion 🌻</title>
  <link id="pageFavicon" data-emoji="🌻" data-png-b64="{{ favicon_uri }}" data-https-png="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kouSeek/portfolio/ai-companion/assets/icons/favicon-anondo.png?v=4" data-https-ico="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kouSeek/portfolio/ai-companion/assets/icons/favicon-anondo.ico?v=4" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="64x64" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kouSeek/portfolio/ai-companion/assets/icons/favicon-anondo.png?v=4" />
  <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kouSeek/portfolio/ai-companion/assets/icons/favicon-anondo.ico?v=4" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="64x64" href="{{ favicon_uri }}" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
{{ css_bundle | safe }}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="top-bar">
    <div class="top-bar-inner">
      <div class="brand-wrap" onclick="switchTab('play')">
        <span>🌻 ANONDO</span>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav-tabs">
        <button id="tabPlay" class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('play')">🎯 Today's Flow</button>
        <button id="tabLetter" class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('letter')">💌 Letter</button>
        <button id="tabPillars" class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('pillars')">🧭 7 Keys</button>
      </nav>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;">
        <button id="topPlayBtn" class="hctrl-btn" data-default-label="🔊 Listen" onclick="toggleMasterAudio()">🔊 Listen</button>
        <button class="sos-btn" onclick="openSosModal()">🚨 Calm Switch</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="nowPlayingBar" class="now-playing-bar" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="eq-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      <span id="npTitle" class="np-title">Playing...</span>
      <div id="npTrack" class="np-track" onclick="seekAudioFromTrack(event)">
        <div id="npFill" class="np-fill"></div>
      </div>
      <span id="npTime" class="np-time">0:00</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section id="viewPlay" class="view-pane active">
      <div id="dayStrip" class="day-strip"></div>

      <div class="hero-banner">
        <div class="hero-top-row">
          <span class="hero-pill" id="heroPhasePill">✨ As the day, so is the day • Zero-Rule Living</span>
          <button class="off-duty-btn" onclick="toggleOffDutyMode()" id="offDutyBtn">🌿 Off-Duty Caretaker</button>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-title" id="heroDayTitle"></div>
        <div class="hero-sub" id="heroDaySub"></div>
        <button id="btnDayMainPlay" class="big-voice-btn" data-default-label="🔊 Listen to Today's Overview" onclick="toggleDayVoice()">
          🔊 Listen to Today's Overview
        </button>
        <div class="day-prev-next-row">
          <button id="prevDayBtn" class="day-nav-btn" onclick="selectDay(curDay - 1, true)">⬅️ Previous Day</button>
          <button id="nextDayBtn" class="day-nav-btn" onclick="selectDay(curDay + 1, true)">Next Day ➡️</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="game-nav-card">
        <div class="game-nav-header">
          <span class="game-nav-title">🎯 Today's 5 Explorations (Tap any tile):</span>
        </div>
        <div id="gameGrid" class="game-grid"></div>
      </div>

      <div id="activeGameStage"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="viewLetter" class="view-pane">
      <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFFBEB,#FEF3C7);border-color:#FCD34D;">
        <div style="font-size:0.84rem;font-weight:700;color:#92400E;margin-bottom:6px;">☀️ Daily Anchor</div>
        <div id="quoteBox" style="font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:600;color:#78350F;margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <button id="btnQuotePlay" class="ag-btn listen" data-default-label="🔊 Listen" onclick="toggleQuoteAudio()">🔊 Listen</button>
          <button class="ag-btn" onclick="nextQuote(true)">🎲 Next Anchor</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="letterStage" class="card"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="viewPillars" class="view-pane">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card-badge">🧭 Wiki-Grounded Diagnostic</span>
        <h2 class="card-title" style="margin-top:8px;">Your 7 Core Keys (Zero Guilt, Pure Leverage)</h2>
        <p class="card-story">
          Whenever melancholy, RAM crowding, hesitation, or listening lag shows up, pick the exact key that unlocks it:
        </p>
        <div id="pillarsContainer" class="pillar-grid"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div id="sosModal" class="modal-backdrop">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;">
        <span class="card-badge" style="background:#FFE4E6;color:#BE123C;margin:0;">🚨 60-Second Hardware Brake</span>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="closeSosModal()">✕ Close</button>
      </div>
      <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Koushik, you are 100% safe and your mind is completely sound.</h3>
      <p class="card-story" style="font-size:0.94rem;margin-bottom:12px;">
        When baseline dopamine dips, an ADHD-High-IQ brain sometimes manufactures counterfeit adrenaline and urges to confess 15-year-old regrets. <strong>Cut power to the simulation physically before thinking a single word:</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="prompt-box" style="background:#EFF6FF;border-color:#BFDBFE;">
        <div class="prompt-lbl" style="color:#1D4ED8;">1. ❄️ Cold-Water Dive Reflex (30 Seconds):</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#1E3A8A;">Cup cold water over your closed eyelids and cheekbones 4 times for 5 seconds each. Triggers the trigeminal-vagal brake and drops heart rate immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prompt-box" style="background:#FEF3C7;border-color:#FDE68A;">
        <div class="prompt-lbl" style="color:#B45309;">2. 🧱 20-Second Isometric Wall Push:</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#78350F;">Press both palms hard into a solid wall for 20 seconds, then release with a long sigh—burning excess adrenaline cleanly out of your muscles.</p>
        <div style="text-align:center;">
          <div id="sosTimerDisplay" class="timer-pill">20s</div><br/>
          <button class="ag-btn listen" style="margin-top:6px;" onclick="startSosTimer(20)">⏱️ Start 20s Timer</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prompt-box" style="background:#F0FDFA;border-color:#99F6E4;">
        <div class="prompt-lbl">3. 🔒 Anti-Confession Vault Lock:</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ink-2);">
          The 33-year-old man is not on trial for the unguided 11-, 17-, 26-, or 30-year-old kid. Bail is 100% paid in full. Zero past excavation while heart rate is elevated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="agenda-actions">
        <a class="ag-btn" href="tel:14416" style="background:#FFF1F2;color:#BE123C;border-color:#FECDD3;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;">📞 Tele-MANAS (14416)</a>
        <button class="ag-btn check checked" onclick="closeSosModal()">🌿 My Body Feels Calmer Now</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="toastEl" class="toast"></div>

  <script>
{{ data_js | safe }}
{{ js_bundle | safe }}
  </script>
</body>
</html>
